<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><style>body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;margin:40px;color:#222;}h1{font-size:20pt;color:#1a237e;}h2{font-size:15pt;color:#1a237e;border-bottom:2px solid #1a237e;padding-bottom:4px;margin-top:28px;}h3{font-size:12pt;color:#283593;margin-top:18px;}h4{font-size:10.5pt;color:#3949ab;margin-top:12px;}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:10pt;}th{background-color:#1a237e;color:white;padding:5px 7px;text-align:left;}td{padding:4px 7px;border:1px solid #bbb;}tr:nth-child(even){background-color:#f0f4ff;}ul{margin:4px 0 8px 18px;}li{margin-bottom:2px;}hr{border:none;border-top:2px solid #1a237e;margin:18px 0;}p{margin:5px 0;}b{color:#1a237e;}</style></head><body><h1 style="color:#1a237e;font-size:22pt;text-align:center;">Teacher's Training Institute of India (TTII)</h1><h2 style="color:#1a237e;font-size:18pt;text-align:center;">LMS Admin Dashboard — Feature Documentation</h2><p style="text-align:center;color:#555;">Comprehensive specification document for Claude Code to recreate all LMS features</p><hr/><h2>1. DASHBOARD OVERVIEW</h2><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/dashboard/index</p><h3>Summary Cards</h3><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Card Title</th><th>Sample Value</th></tr><tr><td>Courses</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Centers</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><td>Students</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Enrolments</td><td>77</td></tr><tr><td>Payments</td><td>7</td></tr></table><p>Cards displayed in a horizontal row at the top. Each card has a colored left border accent, icon, and count. Dashboard is the landing page after login.</p><hr/><h2>2. LEARNER MANAGEMENT</h2><h3>2.1 Applications</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/applications/index</p><h4>Page Header</h4><ul><li>Title: "Applications"</li><li>Button: [+ Add Applications] (top right, primary blue)</li></ul><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>Text</td><td>Name/phone/email</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>All, Pending, Approved, Rejected</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>List of centres</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>List of courses</td></tr><tr><td>Date Range</td><td>Date picker (From/To)</td><td>Filter by application date</td></tr><tr><td>[Search] Button</td><td>Button</td><td>Applies filters</td></tr><tr><td>[Reset] Button</td><td>Button</td><td>Clears all filters</td></tr></table><h4>Applications Table Columns</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Applicant Name</td><td>Clickable link to detail</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Course applied for</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Centre selected</td></tr><tr><td>Applied Date</td><td>Formatted date</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Pending(yellow), Approved(green), Rejected(red) badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Three-dot menu (View, Edit, Delete)</td></tr></table><h4>Add Application Form — 4 Tabs</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/applications/add/</p><p><b>Tab 1: Basic Information</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Req</th></tr><tr><td>First Name</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Last Name</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td>Email</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>Tel</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Alternate Phone</td><td>Tel</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Date of Birth</td><td>Date picker</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Gender</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Yes — Male/Female/Other</td></tr><tr><td>Address Line 1</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Address Line 2</td><td>Text</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Yes — Indian states</td></tr><tr><td>Pincode</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Country</td><td>Text/Dropdown</td><td>Yes — default India</td></tr><tr><td>Profile Photo</td><td>File upload</td><td>No</td></tr></table><p><b>Tab 2: Qualification Details</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Highest Qualification</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>10th,12th,Diploma,Graduate,Post Graduate,PhD</td></tr><tr><td>Specialization/Stream</td><td>Text</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Institution Name</td><td>Text</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Year of Passing</td><td>Year picker</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Percentage/CGPA</td><td>Text</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Work Experience</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Fresher,0-1yr,1-3yrs,3-5yrs,5+yrs</td></tr><tr><td>Current Occupation</td><td>Text</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Documents Upload</td><td>File upload (multiple)</td><td>Certificates, marksheets</td></tr></table><p><b>Tab 3: Enrolment Details</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Select Course</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Active courses</td></tr><tr><td>Select Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Active centres</td></tr><tr><td>Select Batch/Intake</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Based on course+centre</td></tr><tr><td>Enrolment Date</td><td>Date picker</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Fee Plan</td><td>Dropdown/Radio</td><td>Full Payment, Installment Plan</td></tr><tr><td>Discount</td><td>Number</td><td>% or amount</td></tr><tr><td>Referral Code</td><td>Text</td><td>Optional</td></tr></table><p><b>Tab 4: LMS/CRM Specific Information</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Lead Source</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Website,Referral,Social Media,Walk-in,etc.</td></tr><tr><td>Assigned Counsellor</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>List of counsellors</td></tr><tr><td>Application Status</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Pending,Approved,Rejected,On Hold</td></tr><tr><td>Notes/Remarks</td><td>Textarea</td><td>Internal notes</td></tr><tr><td>CRM Tags</td><td>Multi-select/Tags</td><td>Custom tags</td></tr></table><h4>Form Buttons</h4><ul><li>[Save and Next] — saves current tab, moves to next</li><li>[Previous] — returns to previous tab</li><li>[Submit Application] — final submit on last tab</li><li>[Cancel] — cancels, returns to list</li></ul><h4>View Application Detail</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/applications/view/[id] — 3 Tabs:</p><ul><li>Tab 1 - Overview: Basic info, status badge, Edit/Approve/Reject buttons</li><li>Tab 2 - Academic/Professional Details: Qualification info, uploaded documents</li><li>Tab 3 - Enrolment and Payments: Enrolment details, payment history table (Date, Amount, Mode, Status, Receipt)</li></ul><hr/><h3>2.2 Students</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/students/index</p><h4>Page Header</h4><ul><li>Title: "Students"</li><li>Button: [Export] — exports student list as CSV/Excel</li></ul><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>Text — name/email/phone/enrollment ID</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown — Active,Inactive,Graduated,Dropped</td></tr><tr><td>Batch/Cohort</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>[Search] / [Reset]</td><td>Buttons</td></tr></table><h4>Students Table Columns</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Student Name</td><td>Clickable link</td></tr><tr><td>Enrollment ID</td><td>Unique ID</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Batch</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Active/Inactive badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Three-dot menu</td></tr></table><h4>Three-Dot Action Options</h4><ul><li>View</li><li>Edit</li><li>Change Username</li><li>Change Password</li><li>Edit Enrollment ID</li></ul><h4>View Student Detail — 3 Tabs</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/students/view/[id]</p><ul><li>Tab 1 - Overview: Profile photo, Name, DOB, Gender, Phone, Email, Address, Profile completion %</li><li>Tab 2 - Enrolment and Payments: Course, Centre, Batch, Enrollment date, Fee plan, Payment history table</li><li>Tab 3 - LMS Progress: Courses enrolled, progress bars per subject, completion %, last accessed, assignment scores</li></ul><hr/><h3>2.3 Student Referrals</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/students/index (same page as Students — menu links to same URL)</p><p>Referral tracking is integrated into student records. The Student Referrals menu item is a shortcut to the Students list.</p><hr/><h3>2.4 Assignments</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/assignment/index</p><h4>Assignments Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Assignment Title</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Subject</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Total Submissions</td><td>Clickable button e.g. "View 12 Submissions"</td></tr><tr><td>Due Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>View Submissions Page</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/assignment/show_submission/[id]</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Student Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Submitted File/Link</td><td>Downloadable attachment</td></tr><tr><td>Submission Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Pending Review, Reviewed</td></tr><tr><td>Score/Grade</td><td>Editable field</td></tr><tr><td>Remarks</td><td>Instructor feedback text input</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Review, Download</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>2.5 Intake (Batches)</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/batch/index</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Title</td><td>Batch/Intake name</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Active/Inactive badge</td></tr><tr><td>Students</td><td>Button showing count, click to see students in batch</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>2.6 Payments (Learner Payments)</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/payments/index</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Transaction ID</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Student Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Amount</td><td>In INR</td></tr><tr><td>Payment Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Payment Mode</td><td>Online, Cash, Cheque, etc.</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Success/Pending/Failed badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>View Receipt, Download</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>3. CENTRES</h2><h3>3.1 Centre Directory</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/centres/index</p><h4>Page Header</h4><ul><li>Title: "Centre Directory"</li><li>Button: [+ Add Centre]</li></ul><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>Text input</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown (Active/Inactive)</td></tr></table><h4>Centres Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Centre Name</td><td>Clickable</td></tr><tr><td>Contact Person</td><td>Centre coordinator name</td></tr><tr><td>Contact No</td><td>Phone number</td></tr><tr><td>Wallet Balance</td><td>Current balance in INR</td></tr><tr><td>Total Students</td><td>Enrolled students count</td></tr><tr><td>Fund Requests</td><td>Count/link to pending fund requests</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>View (eye icon), Edit (pencil icon), Delete (trash icon)</td></tr></table><h4>Add Centre Form — 4 Sections</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/centres/add</p><p><b>Section 1: Basic Information</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th></tr><tr><td>Centre Name</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Centre Code</td><td>Text</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Centre Type</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Established Date</td><td>Date picker</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Centre Logo</td><td>Image upload</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Description</td><td>Textarea</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Toggle (Active/Inactive)</td><td>Yes</td></tr></table><p><b>Section 2: Contact Information</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Contact Person Name</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Contact Phone</td><td>Tel</td></tr><tr><td>Contact Email</td><td>Email</td></tr><tr><td>Address Line 1</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Address Line 2</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>City</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>State</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Pincode</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Google Maps Link</td><td>URL input</td></tr></table><p><b>Section 3: Affiliation Information</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Affiliation Number</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Affiliation Date</td><td>Date picker</td></tr><tr><td>Affiliation Document</td><td>File upload</td></tr><tr><td>Recognition Status</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr></table><p><b>Section 4: Course Plans Assign</b></p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Select Courses</td><td>Multi-select checkboxes or dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Fee Plan per Course</td><td>Per-course fee configuration fields</td></tr></table><h4>Form Buttons: [Save Centre] [Cancel]</h4><h4>View Centre Detail</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/centres/view/[id] — Shows all 4 sections in read-only mode</p><p>Buttons: [Edit Centre] [Back to List]</p><hr/><h3>3.2 Centre Cohorts</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/centres/cohorts</p><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown (Active/Completed)</td></tr></table><h4>Status Tabs: All | Active | Completed</h4><h4>Centre Cohorts Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Cohort Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Start Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>End Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Total Learners</td><td>Enrolled count</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Active/Completed badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>View button</td></tr></table><h4>View Cohort Detail — 4 Tabs</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/cohorts/view/[id]</p><p><b>Tab 1 - Learners:</b> Table: Name, Enrollment ID, Progress %, Status, Action</p><p><b>Tab 2 - Live Sessions:</b> Table: Title, Date/Time, Platform, Link, Status, Action</p><p><b>Tab 3 - Activities/Assignments:</b> Table: Title, Due Date, Submissions count, Action</p><p><b>Tab 4 - Announcements:</b> List: Title, Message preview, Date, Action</p><p>Buttons on detail page: [+ Add Learner] [+ Add Session] [+ Add Assignment] [+ Post Announcement]</p><hr/><h3>3.3 Centre Payments</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/centres/centre_payments</p><h4>Tab 1: Fund Requests</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Centre name</td></tr><tr><td>Amount</td><td>Requested amount in INR</td></tr><tr><td>Date</td><td>Request date</td></tr><tr><td>Transaction No</td><td>Reference number</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Pending(yellow), Approved(green), Rejected(red) badge</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment</td><td>Download/View uploaded document</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Approve, Reject buttons</td></tr></table><h4>Tab 2: Wallet Transactions</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Centre name</td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Credit(green badge) / Debit(red badge)</td></tr><tr><td>Amount</td><td>Transaction amount in INR</td></tr><tr><td>Remarks</td><td>Description of transaction</td></tr><tr><td>Date</td><td>Transaction date</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>3.4 Wallet Status</h3><p>Wallet Status is part of the Centre Payments section. It shows current wallet balance per centre plus transaction history via the Fund Requests and Wallet Transactions tabs under Centre Payments.</p><hr/><h3>3.5 Chat Support</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/chat_support</p><h4>Layout: Two-panel chat interface</h4><p>Left panel: conversation list | Right panel: active chat window</p><h4>Left Panel Tabs: Students | Centres | Contact</h4><h4>Conversation List Items</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Element</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Avatar/Photo</td><td>User profile picture or initials</td></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Student or Centre name</td></tr><tr><td>Last Message Preview</td><td>Truncated last message</td></tr><tr><td>Timestamp</td><td>Time of last message</td></tr><tr><td>Unread Badge</td><td>Count of unread messages</td></tr></table><h4>Chat Window (Right Panel)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Element</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Header</td><td>Name + online status indicator</td></tr><tr><td>Message Area</td><td>Scrollable history</td></tr><tr><td>Message Bubbles</td><td>Sent (right/blue), Received (left/grey)</td></tr><tr><td>Message Input Box</td><td>Text input at bottom</td></tr><tr><td>Send Button</td><td>Paper plane icon</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment Button</td><td>Upload files/images</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>3.6 Resources</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/resources/index</p><h4>Buttons: [+ Upload File] [+ Add Folder]</h4><h4>File Manager (Grid Layout)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Element</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Folder Cards</td><td>Folder icon, name, item count</td></tr><tr><td>File Cards</td><td>File type icon, name, size, upload date</td></tr><tr><td>Breadcrumb Navigation</td><td>Home &gt; Folder &gt; SubFolder</td></tr><tr><td>File Actions</td><td>Download, Delete, Rename (three-dot menu)</td></tr><tr><td>Folder Actions</td><td>Open, Rename, Delete</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>3.7 Training Videos</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/training_videos</p><h4>Button: [+ Add Video]</h4><h4>Filter Tabs: All | Live | Lectures | Tutorials</h4><h4>Video Cards Grid</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Element</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Thumbnail</td><td>Video thumbnail image</td></tr><tr><td>Video Title</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Category Badge</td><td>Live / Lecture / Tutorial</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>Video length</td></tr><tr><td>Upload Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Action Buttons</td><td>Play/View, Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>Add Video Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Video Title</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Category</td><td>Dropdown (Live/Lecture/Tutorial)</td></tr><tr><td>Video URL (YouTube/Vimeo)</td><td>URL input</td></tr><tr><td>Upload Video File</td><td>File upload (alternative to URL)</td></tr><tr><td>Thumbnail</td><td>Image upload</td></tr><tr><td>Description</td><td>Textarea</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Toggle (Published/Draft)</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>4. COURSES</h2><h3>4.1 Course Directory</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/course/index</p><h4>Button: [+ Create Course]</h4><h4>Courses Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Title</td><td>Course name — clickable</td></tr><tr><td>Category</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Subjects</td><td>Number of subjects/modules</td></tr><tr><td>Enrolled Students</td><td>Total enrollment count</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Active/Archived badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Archive, Edit</td></tr></table><h4>Create Course Form</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/course/add/</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Course Title</td><td>Text</td><td>Required</td></tr><tr><td>Short Name</td><td>Text</td><td>Abbreviated name</td></tr><tr><td>Category</td><td>Dropdown</td><td>Select course category</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>Text/Number</td><td>e.g. 6 months, 1 year</td></tr><tr><td>Course Description</td><td>Rich Text Editor (WYSIWYG)</td><td>Full description with formatting</td></tr><tr><td>Thumbnail</td><td>Image upload</td><td>Course cover image</td></tr><tr><td>Pricing</td><td>Radio buttons</td><td>Free / Paid</td></tr><tr><td>Course Type</td><td>Radio buttons</td><td>Self-paced / Instructor-led / Blended</td></tr><tr><td>Publish Type</td><td>Radio buttons</td><td>Public / Private / Centre-specific</td></tr><tr><td>Referral Point</td><td>Number</td><td>Points for referral</td></tr><tr><td>Who Should Enrol</td><td>Textarea/Rich Text</td><td>Target audience description</td></tr></table><h4>Form Buttons: [Save Course] [Cancel]</h4><h4>Course Subjects View</h4><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/course/add_details/[id]</p><h4>Subject Section Buttons: [+ Add Subject] [Select Subject from DB]</h4><h4>Subjects List Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Subject Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Lessons Count</td><td>Number of lessons</td></tr><tr><td>Order</td><td>Drag to reorder</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>4.2 Add Lessons</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/course_new/index</p><h4>Selection Steps</h4><p>Step 1: Select Primary Course (dropdown) | Step 2: Select Subject (dropdown)</p><h4>Lesson Types Available</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Lesson Type</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td>YouTube Video</td><td>Embed YouTube video lesson</td></tr><tr><td>Vimeo Video</td><td>Embed Vimeo video lesson</td></tr><tr><td>Quiz</td><td>Interactive quiz/assessment</td></tr><tr><td>Article</td><td>Text-based article content</td></tr><tr><td>Document</td><td>PDF/DOC file upload</td></tr><tr><td>Audio</td><td>Audio file lesson</td></tr></table><h4>Section Buttons</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Button</th><th>Action</th></tr><tr><td>[+ Videos]</td><td>Add YouTube or Vimeo video lesson</td></tr><tr><td>[+ Audio]</td><td>Add audio lesson</td></tr><tr><td>[+ Article]</td><td>Add text article lesson</td></tr><tr><td>[+ Document]</td><td>Add PDF/document lesson</td></tr><tr><td>[+ Quiz]</td><td>Add a quiz</td></tr><tr><td>[Sort]</td><td>Reorder lessons via drag-and-drop</td></tr><tr><td>[Edit]</td><td>Edit lesson details</td></tr><tr><td>[Delete]</td><td>Remove lesson</td></tr></table><h4>Lesson Form Fields (Video)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Lesson Title</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Video URL (YouTube/Vimeo)</td><td>URL input</td></tr><tr><td>Description</td><td>Textarea</td></tr><tr><td>Duration</td><td>Time input</td></tr><tr><td>Free Preview</td><td>Toggle (Yes/No)</td></tr></table><h4>Lesson Form Fields (Document/PDF)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Lesson Title</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Upload File</td><td>File upload (PDF/DOC/PPT)</td></tr><tr><td>Description</td><td>Textarea</td></tr></table><h4>Lesson Form Fields (Quiz)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Quiz Title</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Total Questions</td><td>Number</td></tr><tr><td>Pass Percentage</td><td>Number (%)</td></tr><tr><td>Time Limit</td><td>Number (minutes)</td></tr><tr><td>Questions</td><td>Dynamic question builder</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>5. COHORT MANAGEMENT</h2><h3>5.1 Cohorts</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/cohorts/index</p><h4>Button: [+ Add Cohorts]</h4><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown (Active/Completed)</td></tr></table><h4>Status Tabs: All | Active | Completed</h4><h4>Cohorts Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Cohort Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Start Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>End Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Total Learners</td><td>Enrolled count</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Active/Completed badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>View, Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>Add Cohort Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Cohort Name</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Select Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Select Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Start Date</td><td>Date picker</td></tr><tr><td>End Date</td><td>Date picker</td></tr><tr><td>Max Learners</td><td>Number</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Toggle (Active/Inactive)</td></tr></table><h3>5.2 Attendance Management</h3><p><b>Status: Planned but not yet implemented</b> — Returns 404. URL contains server-side template syntax. Feature is in development.</p><h3>5.3 Sessions Feedbacks</h3><p><b>Status: Planned but not yet implemented</b> — Returns 404. Feature is in development.</p><hr/><h2>6. FEE INFORMATION</h2><h3>6.1 Course Fee Status</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/course_fee/index</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Course Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Base Fee</td><td>Original course fee in INR</td></tr><tr><td>Offer Fee</td><td>Discounted price in INR</td></tr><tr><td>View Payments</td><td>Button — opens payment records for this course</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>6.2 Fee Installments</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/fee_management/installments</p><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Student Name/ID</td><td>Text search</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr></table><h4>Status Tabs: All | Fully Added | Partially Added | Not Added</h4><h4>Fee Installments Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Student Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Enrollment ID</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Total Fee</td><td>Total payable amount</td></tr><tr><td>Installments Added</td><td>Count of installments configured</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Fully Added / Partially Added / Not Added badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>View/Edit installment plan</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>6.3 Payment Status</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/fee_management/payment_status</p><h4>Summary Cards (4)</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Card</th><th>Color</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td>OVERDUE</td><td>Red</td><td>Payments past due date</td></tr><tr><td>DUE</td><td>Orange/Yellow</td><td>Payments due today or soon</td></tr><tr><td>UPCOMING</td><td>Blue</td><td>Future scheduled payments</td></tr><tr><td>PAID</td><td>Green</td><td>Completed payments</td></tr></table><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Student</td><td>Text/Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Date Range</td><td>From/To date picker</td></tr></table><h4>Status Tabs: All | Overdue | Due | Upcoming | Paid</h4><h4>Payment Status Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Student Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Course</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Installment No</td><td>e.g. 1st, 2nd, 3rd</td></tr><tr><td>Due Date</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Amount</td><td>In INR</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Overdue/Due/Upcoming/Paid badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Mark as Paid, Send Reminder</td></tr></table><h3>6.4 Scholarships</h3><p><b>Status: Planned but not yet implemented</b> — Returns 404. Feature is in development.</p><hr/><h2>7. INSTRUCTOR</h2><h3>7.1 Instructor Directory</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/instructor/index</p><h4>Button: [+ Add Instructor]</h4><h4>Instructors Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Full name</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>Contact number</td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td>Email address</td></tr><tr><td>OTP</td><td>One-time password for login</td></tr><tr><td>Courses/Enrolled Courses</td><td>Button showing courses assigned</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete, Change Device</td></tr></table><h4>Action Options: Edit | Delete | Change Device (resets device binding for login)</h4><h4>Add Instructor Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Full Name</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td>Email</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>Tel</td></tr><tr><td>Profile Photo</td><td>Image upload</td></tr><tr><td>Bio/Description</td><td>Textarea</td></tr><tr><td>Assign Courses</td><td>Multi-select dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Toggle (Active/Inactive)</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>8. USERS</h2><h3>8.1 Super Admin</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/admin/index</p><h4>Button: [+ Create Super Admin]</h4><h4>Users Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Admin user full name</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>Create Super Admin Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Full Name</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td>Email</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>Tel</td></tr><tr><td>Password</td><td>Password</td></tr><tr><td>Confirm Password</td><td>Password</td></tr><tr><td>Role</td><td>Dropdown (Super Admin / Admin)</td></tr></table><h3>8.2 Admin</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/admin/index — Same page as Super Admin. Role badge distinguishes between Super Admin and Admin. Both managed from same Users list with role filter.</p><hr/><h2>9. COUNSELLORS</h2><h3>9.1 Counsellors Directory</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/counsellor/index</p><h4>Summary Card: Total Counsellors count</h4><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown (Active/Inactive)</td></tr><tr><td>Centre</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr></table><h4>Counsellors Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Active Status</td><td>Active/Inactive toggle or badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete, View Profile</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>9.2 Counsellor Target</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/counsellor_target/index</p><h4>Counsellor Target Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Counsellor Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Target type badge (Applications/Revenue/etc.)</td></tr><tr><td>Point/Count</td><td>Target value</td></tr><tr><td>From</td><td>Period start date</td></tr><tr><td>To</td><td>Period end date</td></tr><tr><td>Achieved Point/Count</td><td>Actual performance</td></tr><tr><td>Performance %</td><td>Achieved/Target x 100</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>Add/Edit Target Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Select Counsellor</td><td>Dropdown</td></tr><tr><td>Target Type</td><td>Dropdown (Applications, Enrolments, Revenue)</td></tr><tr><td>Target Value</td><td>Number</td></tr><tr><td>Period From</td><td>Date picker</td></tr><tr><td>Period To</td><td>Date picker</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>10. ASSOCIATES</h2><h3>10.1 Associates Directory</h3><p><b>URL:</b> /admin/associates/index</p><h4>Summary Card: Total Associates count</h4><h4>Filter Section</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Dropdown (Active/Inactive)</td></tr></table><h4>Associates Table</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Associate full name</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Active Status</td><td>Active/Inactive toggle or badge</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><h4>Button: [+ Add Associate]</h4><h4>Add Associate Form</h4><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Field</th><th>Type</th></tr><tr><td>Full Name</td><td>Text</td></tr><tr><td>Email</td><td>Email</td></tr><tr><td>Phone</td><td>Tel</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>Toggle (Active/Inactive)</td></tr></table><hr/><h3>10.2 Associates Target</h3><p>Same structure as Counsellor Target</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#1a237e;color:white;"><th>Column</th><th>Notes</th></tr><tr><td>Associate Name</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Target type badge</td></tr><tr><td>Target Value</td><td>Point/Count set as target</td></tr><tr><td>From</td><td>Period start date</td></tr><tr><td>To</td><td>Period end date</td></tr><tr><td>Achieved</td><td>Actual performance value</td></tr><tr><td>Performance %</td><td>Progress %</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>Edit, Delete</td></tr></table><hr/><h2>11. GLOBAL UI DESIGN PATTERNS</h2><h3>11.1 Navigation Sidebar</h3><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Background Color</td><td>Dark navy/indigo (#1a237e or similar dark blue)</td></tr><tr><td>Text Color</td><td>White</td></tr><tr><td>Active Item</td><td>Highlighted with lighter blue or accent color</td></tr><tr><td>Menu Items</td><td>Expandable accordion sub-menus with arrow indicator</td></tr><tr><td>Logo/Brand</td><td>TTII logo at top of sidebar</td></tr><tr><td>Width</td><td>~250px when expanded</td></tr><tr><td>Collapsible</td><td>Yes — toggle button to collapse sidebar</td></tr></table><h3>11.2 Color Palette</h3><table border="1" cellpadding="6"><tr style="background:#e8eaf6;"><th>Usage</th><th>Color</th></tr><tr><td>Primary/Brand</td><td>Dark Blue/Indigo (#1a237e)</td></tr><tr><td>Primary Button</td><td>Blue (#1565c0 or #1976d2)</td></tr><tr><td>Success/Active</td><td>Green (#2e7d32 or #43a047)</td></tr><tr><td>Warning/Pending</td><td>Yellow/Amber (#f57f17 or #ffa000)</td></tr><tr><td>Danger/Error</td><td>Red (#c62828 or #e53935)</td></tr><tr><td>Info/Secondary</td><td>Teal/Cyan (#00838f)</td></tr><tr><td>Background</td><td>Light grey (#f5f5f5 or #fafafa)</td></tr><tr><td>Card Background</td><td>White (#ffffff)</td></tr><tr><td>Table Header</td><td>Dark Blue (#1a237e) with white text</td></tr><tr><td>Table Row Hover</td><td>Light blue (#e3f2fd)</td></tr></table><h3>11.3 Recurring UI Components</h3><p><b>Status Badges:</b> Pill-shaped colored labels — Active=green, Inactive=grey, Pending=yellow, Approved=green, Rejected=red, Overdue=red, Paid=green, Credit=green, Debit=red</p><p><b>Action Menus:</b> Three-dot vertical menu (&#8942;) on each table row — reveals dropdown on click</p><p><b>Filter Bars:</b> Consistent filter section above each table with search input, dropdowns, Search and Reset buttons</p><p><b>Data Tables:</b> Paginated tables with column headers, alternating row colors, hover highlighting. Pagination at bottom with items-per-page selector (10/25/50/100)</p><p><b>Form Layouts:</b> Card-based sections with headings, 2-column grid for fields, required field asterisk (*), inline validation errors below fields</p><p><b>Tab Navigation:</b> Horizontal tabs for detail pages and filtered views; active tab has colored bottom border highlight</p><p><b>Summary/Stat Cards:</b> Dashboard-style cards with large number, label text, and icon. Left border accent color per card type</p><p><b>Breadcrumbs:</b> Navigation trail at top of detail pages (e.g., Dashboard &gt; Students &gt; View Student)</p><p><b>Modal Dialogs:</b> Used for delete confirmations and quick-edit forms</p><p><b>Rich Text Editor:</b> WYSIWYG editor (TinyMCE or CKEditor) for description and content fields</p><p><b>File Upload:</b> Drag-and-drop upload areas with file type and size restrictions</p><p><b>Toggle Switches:</b> iOS-style toggle for Active/Inactive status</p><p><b>Date Pickers:</b> Calendar popup date pickers with range selection where needed</p><h3>11.4 Page Layout Structure</h3><p>Standard layout: Fixed Sidebar (left, ~250px) + Scrollable Main Content Area (right)</p><p>Main Content flow: Top navbar (user avatar + logout + notifications) → Breadcrumb → Page Title + Action Buttons (right-aligned) → Filter Section (collapsible) → Content Area (table or grid) → Pagination</p><h3>11.5 Planned Features (Not Yet Implemented)</h3><ul><li><b>Attendance Management</b> — Under Cohort Management. Returns 404. In development.</li><li><b>Sessions Feedbacks</b> — Under Cohort Management. Returns 404. In development.</li><li><b>Scholarships</b> — Under Fee Information. Returns 404. In development.</li></ul></body></html>